## 1. Scope and Definitions

“Author” means geekMus, but only with respect to the parts of the Project for which geekMus owns or controls the relevant rights.

“Project” means the source code, scripts, documentation, and other materials in this repository that the Author owns or controls and makes available under this License. Third-party materials are not covered by this License unless their respective rights holders expressly place them under it; those materials remain subject to their own licenses and notices.

“Non-Commercial Purpose” means use in a genuinely personal capacity, including personal learning, study, research, and experimentation, or use in a non-commercial community or open-source project, provided the use is not carried out for, on behalf of, or as part of the business operations or work duties of a business or organization.

“Commercial Purpose” includes, without limitation:
- use by or on behalf of a company, business, or other organization for its internal operations, work assignments, product development, testing, deployment, or service delivery;
- incorporation into or use to develop, operate, or support a commercial product or service;
- providing hosting, consulting, support, or other services for commercial advantage or compensation; and
- selling, licensing for a fee, commercially distributing, or bundling the Project or a derivative version for sale.

For clarity, a person's genuine personal learning or experimentation remains a Non-Commercial Purpose merely because that person is employed by a company, provided the activity is not performed on the company's behalf or as part of their work duties.

