## 4. Donations and Non-Commercial Community Projects

A non-commercial community or open-source project may accept voluntary donations or sponsorships. Receiving donations or sponsorships does not, by itself, make the project a Commercial Purpose, provided that the payments are voluntary and are not consideration for access to the Project, a license, paid features, commercial services, or other commercial benefits.

The actual nature and purpose of the activity, rather than the label given to a payment, determine whether it is commercial.

